0..56 Comment "//! A doubly recursive function of twelve levels answers"
57..85 Comment "//! true without allocating."
86..89 Comment "//!"
90..171 Comment "//! Boespflug, Dénès and Grégoire make 2^27 trivial calls, so the run measures"
172..247 Comment "//! calls without garbage collection. Their native code gained most on that"
248..261 Comment "//! workload."
262..265 Comment "//!"
266..341 Comment "//! Each level calls the level below twice and answers a constant. The path"
342..380 Comment "//! reads the answer at twelve levels."
381..384 Comment "//!"
385..464 Comment "//! - cites: [Boespflug-2011-full_reduction_at_full_throttle], § 4, RecNoAlloc"
465..503 Comment "//! - see: #2282 — the benchmark set"
504..507 Comment "//!"
508..674 Comment "//! [Boespflug-2011-full_reduction_at_full_throttle]: https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-642-25379-9_26 \"Boespflug, Dénès and Grégoire, Full Reduction at Full Throttle\""
